    "adultDose": "Blood, IAI, Pneumonia, UTI, SSTI: 1-2g IV QD (可拆成兩劑，q12h給藥)\nMeningitis: 2g IV q12h\nGonorrhea: 500mg IM single dose\nSurgical prophylaxis: 1g IV 術前0.5-2hr給藥\nMax 4g/day. Infuse 30 min.",
    "pediatricDose": "常見 IV dose: 70 mg/kg/day \n\n50-75 mg/kg/day QD or divided q12h (up to 100 mg/kg/day severe); \nMeningitis: 100 mg/kg/day divided q12h; \nMax 4g/day. \n\nCONTRAINDICATED neonates ≤28 days with IV calcium. \nAvoid in hyperbilirubinemic neonates.",
