    "drugInteractions": "AVOID: Tizanidine (contraindicated). CYP1A2 substrates (theophylline↑, caffeine↑, clozapine↑). \nSpace 2h from antacids/iron/calcium/dairy. \nWarfarin (↑INR), corticosteroids (↑tendon rupture), NSAIDs (↑seizure risk)",
